---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Projets, Laije Belthassar BALONG"
  description="Études personnelles, projets d'équipe et travaux certifiants de Laije Belthassar BALONG, Business Analyst : question de départ, rôle, méthode, résultats et limites."
  active="projets"
  current={true}
>

<p style="margin: 40px 0 0"><a href="/" class="btn btn-line" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 16px; border: 1px solid #D5D9D4; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; color: #17191A; font-size: 14px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3F6B57" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 6l-6 6 6 6"></path></svg>Retour à l'accueil</a></p>

<section style="padding: 40px 0 40px">
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.03em">Projets</h1>
<p style="margin: 20px 0 0; max-width: 60ch; font-size: 19px; color: #4A504E">Études personnelles, projets d'équipe et travaux certifiants. Chaque fiche présente la question de départ, mon rôle, la méthode, les résultats et les limites.</p>
</section>

<div role="group" aria-label="Filtrer par étape de méthode" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding-bottom: 32px">
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filtre="tous" aria-pressed="true" style="min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #3F6B57; background: #3F6B57; color: #FFFFFF; font: 500 15px 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif; cursor: pointer">Tous les projets</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filtre="recueillir" aria-pressed="false" style="min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #D5D9D4; background: #FFFFFF; color: #17191A; font: 500 15px 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif; cursor: pointer">Recueillir le besoin</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filtre="modeliser" aria-pressed="false" style="min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #D5D9D4; background: #FFFFFF; color: #17191A; font: 500 15px 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif; cursor: pointer">Modéliser le processus</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filtre="rediger" aria-pressed="false" style="min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #D5D9D4; background: #FFFFFF; color: #17191A; font: 500 15px 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif; cursor: pointer">Rédiger les exigences</button>
<button type="button" class="chip" data-filtre="verifier" aria-pressed="false" style="min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #D5D9D4; background: #FFFFFF; color: #17191A; font: 500 15px 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif; cursor: pointer">Vérifier par la recette</button>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid #E3E5E1; margin-bottom: 104px">
<a href="/projet-ouverture-compte" data-etapes="modeliser rediger" class="card" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px 40px; padding: 32px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E1; border-top: 1px solid transparent; text-decoration: none; color: #17191A">
<span style="flex: 0 0 150px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160; padding-top: 6px">Octobre 2026</span>
<span style="flex: 999 1 440px; min-width: 0; display: block">
<span style="display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Ouverture d&#x27;un compte particulier en agence</span>
<span style="display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: #4A504E">Parcours supposé du client modélisé en BPMN sur 3 couloirs. 4 points à vérifier, 5 pistes en user stories priorisées en MoSCoW.</span>
<span style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px">
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">Modéliser</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">Rédiger</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #F1F2EF; color: #4A504E; font-size: 13px">Étude personnelle</span>
</span>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 0 0 auto; align-self: center; font-size: 22px; color: #3F6B57">→</span>
</a>
<a href="/projet-ndako-tech" data-etapes="recueillir rediger verifier" class="card" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px 40px; padding: 32px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E1; border-top: 1px solid transparent; text-decoration: none; color: #17191A">
<span style="flex: 0 0 150px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160; padding-top: 6px">Octobre 2026</span>
<span style="flex: 999 1 440px; min-width: 0; display: block">
<span style="display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Ndako Tech</span>
<span style="display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: #4A504E">Plateforme de recherche de logement. Lead Business Analyst d&#x27;une squad de 9 : BRD, FRD, 32 user stories, cahier de recette de 34 cas.</span>
<span style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px">
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">Recueillir</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">Rédiger</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">Vérifier</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #F1F2EF; color: #4A504E; font-size: 13px">Projet d&#x27;équipe</span>
</span>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 0 0 auto; align-self: center; font-size: 22px; color: #3F6B57">→</span>
</a>
<a href="/projet-tableau-de-bord" data-etapes="" class="card" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px 40px; padding: 32px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E1; border-top: 1px solid transparent; text-decoration: none; color: #17191A">
<span style="flex: 0 0 150px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160; padding-top: 6px">[DATE]</span>
<span style="flex: 999 1 440px; min-width: 0; display: block">
<span style="display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Tableau de bord ventes et SAV</span>
<span style="display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: #4A504E">Deux pages sous Looker Studio pour un constructeur automobile fictif : 58 118 unités vendues, 78,4 M$ de profit, retours SAV analysés.</span>
<span style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px">
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">Analyse de données</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #F1F2EF; color: #4A504E; font-size: 13px">TP certifiant IBM</span>
</span>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 0 0 auto; align-self: center; font-size: 22px; color: #3F6B57">→</span>
</a>
<a href="/projet-bracovoit" data-etapes="recueillir modeliser rediger" class="card" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px 40px; padding: 32px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E1; border-top: 1px solid transparent; text-decoration: none; color: #17191A">
<span style="flex: 0 0 150px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160; padding-top: 6px">Juillet 2026</span>
<span style="flex: 999 1 440px; min-width: 0; display: block">
<span style="display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em">BraCovoit</span>
<span style="display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: #4A504E">Covoiturage entre quartiers de Brazzaville. Cahier des charges, 2 processus BPMN, 18 user stories et un backlog découpé en 2 sprints.</span>
<span style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px">
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">Recueillir</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">Modéliser</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">Rédiger</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #F1F2EF; color: #4A504E; font-size: 13px">Simulation d&#x27;entreprise, Akieni Academy</span>
</span>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 0 0 auto; align-self: center; font-size: 22px; color: #3F6B57">→</span>
</a>

<p id="vide" hidden style="margin: 0; padding: 40px 8px; color: #5B6160">Aucun projet publié pour cette étape pour l'instant.</p>

</div>

<script is:inline>
(function(){
  var acc = '#3F6B57';
  var btns = document.querySelectorAll('[data-filtre]');
  var rows = document.querySelectorAll('[data-etapes]');
  var vide = document.getElementById('vide');
  btns.forEach(function(b){
    b.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var f = b.getAttribute('data-filtre'), n = 0;
      btns.forEach(function(x){
        var on = x === b;
        x.setAttribute('aria-pressed', on ? 'true' : 'false');
        x.style.background = on ? acc : '#FFFFFF';
        x.style.color = on ? '#FFFFFF' : '#17191A';
        x.style.borderColor = on ? acc : '#D5D9D4';
      });
      rows.forEach(function(r){
        var ok = f === 'tous' || (' ' + r.getAttribute('data-etapes') + ' ').indexOf(' ' + f + ' ') > -1;
        r.style.display = ok ? 'flex' : 'none'; if (ok) n++;
      });
      if (vide) vide.hidden = n > 0;
    });
  });
})();
</script>

</BaseLayout>
